  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "85a1d87a-a5e7-f44d-a365-3cda7c5839b8"],
 " selects its lowest-energy eigenstates after sorting."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->1918164110,ExpressionUUID->"71f061b4-afba-934c-9b9a-25b4a0305cfd"],

